0.118 0.161 0.231 rg
44. 573.8899999999999864 Td
(The system previously authenticated users successfully but could report that the associated profile could not be) Tj
T* (loaded. The principal defect was a concurrency race between the password login path and Supabase) Tj
T* (authentication state callbacks: a second profile request returned null immediately while the first request was still) Tj
T* (running. This converted a valid login into a false failure and could leave the interface in a misleading state.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
13.7999999999999989 TL
0.118 0.161 0.231 rg
44. 509.6899999999999977 Td
(The remediation is complete and merged. The implementation now coordinates concurrent profile requests, uses) Tj
T* (the authenticated access token for server-side profile reads, bounds all network-dependent profile operations,) Tj
T* (stabilizes the auth listener lifecycle, preserves legacy PIN migration, and prevents infrastructure/profile failures) Tj
T* (from consuming credential lockout attempts.) Tj
ET
